  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Support to EU Delegation in Uzbekistan with Strategic Communication Actions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global objective: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(13, 13, 13);&quot;&gt;To position the EU as a partner of reference for the Republic of Uzbekistan and its people, including political and development cooperation priorities relevant to the concerns and interests of people in the country&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specific objectives: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(13, 13, 13);&quot;&gt;To measurably increase the awareness, understanding and perception of the EU and its partnership with the country, among key target audiences. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
